  "title": "Egg-Free Brownies",
  "description": "Did you know you can make brownies without eggs? These chocolate brownies are a delicious treat and can be made vegan by using plant-based butter.",
  "authors": [
    "Bridget Brooke"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-07-27T09:26:07-04:00",
